    "Name": "Annihilator",
    "Details": "A unique FrankenMech created by the Tooth of Ymir Mercenary unit, the 100 ton Schwerer Gustav was built from parts sourced from a variety of destroyed mechs and grafted onto the remains of a salvaged Annihilator. Powered by a 400-rated XL Engine, the Schwerer Gustav mounts a Thumper Artillery Piece, with a Binary Laser and a Clan RAC/5 for close range combat. Intended as a Command Mech, a Command Console is mounted in the head and a Bloodhound Active Probe in the Center Torso. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.2</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Upper</color>",
